1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,200
Captain Pip lost a sock.

2
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:06,290
So he drew a map, and found a crew.

3
00:00:09,350 --> 00:00:11,300
Pip, the captain.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,710
Brisket, who cooks.

5
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:16,100
Longshanks, who navigates.

6
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,180
Dot, who looks out.

7
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:20,800
Barnacle, who fixes things.

8
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,600
Sometimes.

9
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:26,990
Nine long days across the Warm Wide Sea.

10
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:32,230
Then came a storm.

11
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:40,350
It was a duck. A very large, very hungry duck.

12
00:00:40,350 --> 00:00:42,550
Brisket shared his lunch.

13
00:00:42,550 --> 00:00:46,450
X marked the spot. Inside was one sock.

14
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:48,250
A left one.

15
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:56,090
The right one was drying on the tap.
